{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Segoe UI;}}\f0\fs24\b Magic Trackpad Setup\b0\par
Magic Trackpad Setup is community software for Windows 11 x64. Installation includes the v2.3 driver, its control panel, and a battery monitor that starts at sign-in. Open Magic Trackpad from Start for settings.\par
\par Magic Trackpad Setup's original code is available under the MIT License included with its source. The upstream driver and control panel are distributed with their GPLv2 license and corresponding source in the ThirdParty folder.\par
\par Uninstall Magic Trackpad Setup through Settings, Apps, Installed apps. The driver stays available to your trackpad.\par}
